function routeCanary(request, canaryPercentage) {
  const hash = hashTenantId(request.tenantId);
  return hash < canaryPercentage ? 'canary' : 'stable';
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to triage, choose concrete signals, and perform automated rollback under pressure without customer impact.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant latency metrics (p95/p99)
- Backlog and ingestion lag
- Feature flags and weighted traffic routing
- Grace periods and rollback gates
